      "uz_compare": "O'zbekchada xizmatga qo'ng'iroqda ham shunday gapiramiz: 'Kir mashinasi buzildi, qachon kela olasiz?' Koreyschada vergul o'rnida -는데 turadi.",
      "compare_en": "English joins these with a dash or 'so': 'The washer broke — when can you come?'. Korean links them with -는데."
    },
    {
      "id": "b3_u06_l2_g2",
      "pattern": "V-(으)ㄹ N",
      "meaning_uz": "...adigan (kelasi zamon sifatdoshi)",
      "meaning_en": "N to do / N that will … (future modifier)",
      "explanation_md": "**V-(으)ㄹ N** — fe'lni otdan oldin qo'yib, **hali bo'ladigan** yoki **qilinishi kerak** bo'lgan ish orqali otni tasvirlaydi: \"**...adigan N**\", \"**...ishga N**\".\n\n**내일 올 기사님** — *ertaga keladigan usta*  \n**마실 물이 없어요.** — *Ichadigan suv yo'q.*\n\n### Qanday yasaladi\n\n- O'zak **받침siz** → **-ㄹ**: 오다 → **올**, 마시다 → **마실**, 빨래하다 → **빨래할**\n- O'zak **받침 bilan** → **-을**: 먹다 → **먹을**, 읽다 → **읽을**\n- **ㄹ** bilan → o'zgarmaydi: 만들다 → **만들**\n- **고치다** → **고칠**\n\n### Uchala zamon (4-1 bilan solishtiring)\n\n- **본 영화** — ko'rgan kino\n- **보는 영화** — ko'rayotgan kino\n- **볼 영화** — ko'radigan kino\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- **N이/가 없다** bilan ko'p: **고칠 시간이 없어요**, **먹을 게 없어요**.\n- 1-kitobdagi **-(으)ㄹ까요?**, 2-kitobdagi **-(으)ㄹ 거예요** ham shu **-(으)ㄹ** dan.",
      "explanation_md_en": "**V-(으)ㄹ N** puts a verb before a noun to describe it by something that **will happen** or **is to be done**: \"**N to …**\", \"**N that will …**\".\n\n**내일 올 기사님** — *the technician who'll come tomorrow*  \n**마실 물이 없어요.** — *There's no water to drink.*\n\n### How to form it\n\n- Stem **without 받침** → **-ㄹ**: 오다 → **올**, 마시다 → **마실**, 빨래하다 → **빨래할**\n- Stem **with 받침** → **-을**: 먹다 → **먹을**, 읽다 → **읽을**\n- **ㄹ** stem → unchanged: 만들다 → **만들**\n- **고치다** → **고칠**\n\n### All three tenses (compare 4-1)\n\n- **본 영화** — the film I saw\n- **보는 영화** — the film I'm watching\n- **볼 영화** — the film I'll watch\n\n### Remember\n\n- Very common with **N이/가 없다**: **고칠 시간이 없어요**, **먹을 게 없어요**.\n- **-(으)ㄹ까요?** (book 1) and **-(으)ㄹ 거예요** (book 2) come from this same **-(으)ㄹ**.",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "받침 yo'q",
          "condition_en": "No 받침",
          "rule": "V + ㄹ N",
          "example": "올 기사, 마실 물"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "받침 bor",
          "condition_en": "With 받침",
          "rule": "V + 을 N",
          "example": "먹을 것, 읽을 책"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "ㄹ bilan",
          "condition_en": "Ends in ㄹ",
          "rule": "V + N (o'zgarishsiz)",
